{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_604_ap_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_604_ap_01_title", "source_sha256": "8db6b9249c799ab77701622f6365fd12cd8c91e0a37d454ab6bf5290b6ce7897", "ja": "新たなエージェント達？", "zh": "新特工们？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_604_ap_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_604_ap_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "d0d33b0b70bbff3d2f8e246dc2262c4bd1eee72824616606acb422788c0bfa6d", "ja": "手にした者に力を与えるという『月の宝』\n……この秘宝を巡る争いに、今まさに\n飛び込もうとするエージェント達がいた。\n『サイレント』『ミサキ』『P』による\nラビットシティを守る戦いが今、始まる！", "zh": "据说能赋予持有者力量的“月之宝”\n……此刻，正有几名特工\n准备投身于争夺这件秘宝的斗争。\n由“沉默”“美咲”和“P”守护兔子城的\n战斗，现在开始！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_604_ap_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_604_ap_01_1000_101kot", "source_sha256": "c310fddb491fa96be85b8acd9e1191a522ddef44c21bd165261aa709a5e9efb2", "ja": "………情報を整理しましょう。", "zh": "………我们来整理一下情报吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_604_ap_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_604_ap_01_1001_101kot", "source_sha256": "6b6d4888aeb5204972006c37d646cff305b20e5819d4da6d418dbacca6fc4ec3", "ja": "今、この街には5つの『月の宝』が隠されていて、\n各組織がそれを狙っている……ここまではいいわね？", "zh": "现在，这座城市里藏着5件“月之宝”，\n各个组织都在觊觎它们……到这里都没问题吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_604_ap_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_604_ap_01_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "5669dcad700263968fbe4a98b1aaf50c09641d8f367ac996448f03ca1995eab7", "ja": "はい！　月の宝はそれぞれ、ものすごい力を\n持っていますから。悪い人の手に渡ったら大変です。", "zh": "是的！月之宝物各自都蕴含着惊人的力量。要是落入坏人手里，可就糟糕了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_604_ap_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_604_ap_01_1003_102mis", "source_sha256": "2e2b0d9150089322f5afe1d4326142fd86e416cc9233e72f993f1e60cebffde6", "ja": "そうなる前に見つけ出さないと！", "zh": "在那之前一定要找出来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_604_ap_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_604_ap_01_1004_101kot", "source_sha256": "679ff8438abd855e24f9dc982ca4aaa6dfd925b90c74ff1de00bae96d47569e6", "ja": "つまり、世界の命運は私達が握ってるということね……\nなんだかちょっと、ドキドキするわ。", "zh": "也就是说，世界的命运掌握在我们手中呢……总觉得，心里有点扑通扑通的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_604_ap_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_604_ap_01_1005_102mis", "source_sha256": "ec984eba1bcc8b2732a01c87c4e1c39637987db5d08050581d17ab8ec4e77c03", "ja": "えへへ、私もです！　頑張りましょうね、\n音無先輩、{$P$}さん！", "zh": "嘿嘿，我也是！一起加油吧，\n音无前辈、{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_604_ap_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_604_ap_01_1006_p", "source_sha256": "fafa669efee47579f75a6950601b2d821965112e07d4a4be2fd0dfc8932f69ed", "ja": "そうですね！　ところでその前に、\n一体どういう状況か、説明してほしいんですが……。", "zh": "是啊！不过在那之前，能不能先说明一下，这到底是怎么回事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_604_ap_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_604_ap_01_1007_101kot", "source_sha256": "f7b6c6603d55d43b74a7d9d941bb81ac73341a44b45a5b162f8bf1f57783a329", "ja": "あらっ、そうでしたね！\nそれじゃまずは、最初から……こほん。", "zh": "哎呀，也是呢！\n那么首先，从头开始讲起……咳咳。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_604_ap_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_604_ap_01_1008_101kot", "source_sha256": "afa0242672159d3b6247f2b3e0d42d53cf6602de3544bfed0678d9b69f0de3a6", "ja": "普段はしがない芸能事務所の優秀な事務員。\n可憐で心優しい、みんなのお姉さん……", "zh": "平日里，她是一家普通演艺事务所里出色的事务员。\n温柔可人，是大家的大姐姐……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_604_ap_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_604_ap_01_1009_101kot", "source_sha256": "f92e55d77ed07dacea83f761fd1ebf698e7bf731e2daef638f0b5091ef6a9a86", "ja": "しかし、その正体は……ラビットシティの平和を守る\n正義のエージェント、コードネーム『サイレント』！", "zh": "然而，她的真实身份却是……守护兔子城和平的正义特工，代号“沉默”！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_604_ap_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_604_ap_01_1010_102mis", "source_sha256": "03fbdb70d1c5b123e01f82d69626f82f3582c4d88e6a5756045edd7729bd904c", "ja": "わぁ！　音無先輩、流石！　カッコイイです！\nよーし、私も♪", "zh": "哇！音无前辈，不愧是你！太帅了！\n好——我也来♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_604_ap_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_604_ap_01_1011_102mis", "source_sha256": "e3c85c26612a6823a0bb18670ca989f4fb357dd772f467303fcfcd0f9c9692f1", "ja": "普段は、夢いっぱいの劇場の事務員！\n音無先輩の後輩で、みんなの夢をお手伝いする者！", "zh": "平时，是充满梦想的剧场的工作人员！\n音无前辈的后辈，帮助大家实现梦想的人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_604_ap_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_604_ap_01_1012_102mis", "source_sha256": "e8a4ac85a165932e88581adabcfdb9564fcf5b7ccbd2d61c037d74b2002fca5e", "ja": "その正体は、みんなの衣装と明日を作る、\n正義のエージェント、『ミサキ』！", "zh": "她的真实身份是，为大家制作演出服与明天的正义特工——“美咲”！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_604_ap_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_604_ap_01_1013_p", "source_sha256": "1a5014ce453b7ab1b90d3803e6c337fab25161909bd872ca9a1ccd67932899b8", "ja": "…………。\nあれ？　もしかしてこれ、俺も？", "zh": "…………。\n咦？难不成这里面，也包括我？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_604_ap_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_604_ap_01_1014_101kot", "source_sha256": "9c3e0eab7135bbf0124c363d162784a0708abfe045d94917138ffb36a58b21a3", "ja": "もちろんです！", "zh": "那当然！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_604_ap_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_604_ap_01_1015_102mis", "source_sha256": "f87c39ac66a7b2a153e9dfcfe6a9c8bdd908bcab012708a9772d24a1587bb5d3", "ja": "もちろんです♪", "zh": "当然可以♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_604_ap_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_604_ap_01_1016_p", "source_sha256": "99a4d2b9fb284504149356c8c03673afc89f84ac9a8296b938165cbe272ba7f3", "ja": "はい……。いつもはアイドルのプロデューサー……\n最近ちょっと運動不足気味な……サラリーマン？", "zh": "是……平时是偶像的制作人……\n最近似乎有点运动不足的……上班族？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_604_ap_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_604_ap_01_1017_p", "source_sha256": "090cc58a8d12fd9d4f81c56767306c254be6879f8788078c3b40054e074ef9ba", "ja": "その正体は……えーと……。\nコードネーム『P』！", "zh": "真正身份是……呃……代号“P”！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_604_ap_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_604_ap_01_1018_101kot", "source_sha256": "6b5c02bb4ecfca892a5eba99700e7e5cf5ec099c0aa47b400fdfc78bb427513e", "ja": "それでは、『P』さん、『ミサキ』ちゃん！\n私達で力を合わせ、隠されたお宝を見つけ出して……。", "zh": "那么，『P』先生，还有美咲！\n让我们齐心协力，一起找出隐藏的宝藏……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_604_ap_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_604_ap_01_1019_102mis", "source_sha256": "338f6f36ee3bb3c483a41052404c0be8c9debc4b464fd5a55f8f14ee2ea234e7", "ja": "はい！　ラビットシティの平和を、\nみんなの手で守りましょう♪", "zh": "好的！让我们用大家的双手守护兔子城的和平吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
